["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">舞</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>舞蹈；飞舞；盘旋；旋转</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ブ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ま.う・-ま.う・まい</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">お見舞い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おみまい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">探病；慰问；问候；慰问信；慰问函；祝愿康复的信；慰问品；击中；命中；打击</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">舞台</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぶたい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">舞台；戏台；舞台演出；舞台表演；话剧；戏剧；故事背景；场景；活动领域；舞台；场所；竞技场；世界</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">見舞い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">みまい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">探望；慰问；问候；慰问信；问候信；慰问礼物</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">亡</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>死亡；灭亡；去世；已故；消亡</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ボウ・モウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">な.い・な.き-・ほろ.びる・ほろ.ぶ・ほろ.ぼす</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">亡くなる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">なくなる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">死亡；去世；逝世</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">死亡</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しぼう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">死亡；死；死亡率</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">亡くす</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">なくす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（因死亡）失去；丧失（妻子、孩子等）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">冷</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>冷；凉；冷却；使凉；变凉</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">レイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つめ.たい・ひ.える・ひ.や・ひ.ややか・ひ.やす・ひ.やかす・さ.める・さ.ます</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">冷たい</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つめたい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">冷的；冰冷的；冻的；冷淡的；冷漠的；无情的；漠不关心的；不友善的；疏远的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">冷蔵庫</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">れいぞうこ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">冷藏柜；冰箱；冷柜</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">冷房</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">れいぼう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">空调；制冷</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">適</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>适合；偶尔；罕见；合格；有能力</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">テキ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かな.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">適当</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">てきとう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">恰当；妥当；适宜；合适；得体；敷衍；不认真；马虎；懒散；草率；含糊其辞；不可靠；不负责任；仓促</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">快適</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かいてき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">舒适；愉快；宜人</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">適切</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">てきせつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">恰当；适当；得体；恰切</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">婦</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>妻子；妇女；新娘</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">フ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">よめ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">看護婦</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんごふ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">护士；女护士</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">主婦</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しゅふ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">家庭主妇；主妇；家庭妇女</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">夫婦</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふうふ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">夫妇；夫妻；婚配的夫妇</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">寄</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>靠近；聚集；顺路停留；寄送；收集</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">よ.る・-よ.り・よ.せる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">寄る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">接近；靠近；走近；聚集；集合；汇聚；顺路拜访；顺道造访；中途停留；变老；（数字等）增加；起皱；产生皱纹；靠着；倚靠；斜靠；抱住对手腰带推动（相扑技法）；商定价格；成交；受（某人）左右；屈从；顺从</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">寄付</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きふ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">捐献；捐赠；贡献</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">年寄</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">としより</span><span class=\"k-wz\">老年人；老人；老年公民；相扑协会理事；退役高级力士教练；德川幕府元老；资深政治家；德川幕府重要地方官员</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">込</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>拥挤；混合；包含；装入；集中</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">-こ.む・こ.む・こ.み・-こ.み・こ.める</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">込む</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こむ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">拥挤；密集；堵塞；复杂；繁复；进入；进去；放入；完全变成；彻底成为；彻底地做；充分地做；保持；维持（沉默、坐姿等）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">人込み</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ひとごみ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">人群；熙攘的人群</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">申し込む</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もうしこむ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">申请；提出申请；求婚；提出调停；提出和平提议；挑战；提出异议；请求面谈；认购；预订</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">顔</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>脸；表情</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ガン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かお</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">笑顔</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">えがお</span><span class=\"k-wz\">笑脸；微笑</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">顔付き</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かおつき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">面容；面貌；神情；表情</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">類</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>种类；类别；同类；类似</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ルイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たぐ.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">種類</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しゅるい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">种类；品种；类型；类别；种（用于计数种类、物种等）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">書類</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょるい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">文件；文书；证件</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">人類</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じんるい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">人类；人类社会</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">余</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>剩余；过多；其他；自己；余数</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヨ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あま.る・あま.り・あま.す・あんま.り</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">余分</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よぶん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">多余；过剩；剩余</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">余裕</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よゆう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">盈余；余地；余量；空间；富余；灵活；范围；从容；镇定；沉着；泰然自若；自满</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">余る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あまる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">剩余；剩下；过剩；过多</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">王</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>王；统治；大人物</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">オウ・-ノウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">王</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">国王；统治者；君主；帝王；大王；巨头；大亨；高手；冠军；（将棋）王将（上手一方所用的王）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">王様</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おうさま</span><span class=\"k-wz\">王；国王</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">王子</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おうじ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">王子；熊野附属神社</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">返</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>归还；返回；回答；报答；消退</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヘン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かえ.す・-かえ.す・かえ.る・-かえ.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">返す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かえす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">归还；返还；放回；翻转；倒转；颠覆；偿还；报复；回报；回应；顶嘴；回答；反驳；反向做……（如反驳；反扔）；再做；反复做</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">返事</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">へんじ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">回复；答复；回答</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">繰り返す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">くりかえす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">重复；再做一遍</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">妻</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>妻子；配偶</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つま</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">妻</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つま</span><span class=\"k-wz\">妻子；配菜（尤指刺身的装饰菜）；装饰菜；陪衬；附带事物；附带的话；插话</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">夫妻</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふさい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">夫妻；夫妇；已婚夫妇</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">背</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>身高；背部；违背；背叛；背后</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ハイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">せ・せい・そむ.く・そむ.ける</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">背</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">背部；后背；反面；背面；椅子靠背；书脊；身高；身材；山脊；山梁</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" la