"kana\" lang=\"ja\">めんきょ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">执照</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">許す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆるす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">允许；准许；同意；批准；原谅；宽恕；饶恕；容忍；豁免；减免；释放；放过；承认；认可；信任；信赖；放松警惕；失分；让出（距离等）；退让</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">抜</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>拔出；抽出；脱落；逃脱；省略</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">バツ・ハツ・ハイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ぬ.く・-ぬ.く・ぬ.き・ぬ.ける・ぬ.かす・ぬ.かる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">抜く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぬく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">拔出；抽出；提取；拔掉；除草；省略；遗漏；省掉；跳过；彻底地做；充分地做；完全地做；使劲地做；放出；排出；排空；排干；挑选；选择；精选；选出；偷取；窃取；除去；去掉；清除；取出；超过；超越；赶过；领先；刺穿；突破；穿过；剪裁；裁剪；用防染法染出图案；夺取；攻占；攻陷；抢先发表；独家报道；（围棋）提子；吃掉对方的棋子；（男性）自慰；（自慰时）射精；拍摄；录制</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">抜ける</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぬける</span><span class=\"k-wz\">脱落；掉落；遗漏；缺失；逃脱；松开；褪色；变色；磨破；穿破（如衣服）；离开；退出（如会议）；清澈；透明（如天空）；心不在焉；粗心；不专心；愚蠢；退出循环（程序）；穿过；通过；垮掉；倒塌；得分超过88分而获胜（不含得分组合的积分）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">海抜</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かいばつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">海拔；海拔高度</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">便</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>便利；信件；粪便；机会</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ベン・ビン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たよ.り</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">便利</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">べんり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">便利；方便；实用</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">郵便局</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆうびんきょく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">邮便局；邮局</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">不便</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふべん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">不便；不方便；麻烦</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">留</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>停止；停留；固定；扣留；保留</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">リュウ・ル</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">と.める・と.まる・とど.める・とど.まる・るうぶる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">留学生</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">りゅうがくせい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">留学生；交换学生</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">留守</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">るす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">不在家；外出；离家；看家；看家人；荒废；疏于看管；怠忽</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">留学</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">りゅうがく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">留学；（暂时）到另一所学校学习（以学习特定技能）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">罪</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>罪；犯罪；过错；责任；责备</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ザイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つみ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">罪</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つみ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">罪行；罪过；轻率行为；不当行为；刑罚；判决；惩罚；过错；责任；应负的责任；轻率；欠考虑</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">犯罪</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はんざい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">犯罪；犯法；违法行为</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">努</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>尽力；勤勉；尽可能</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ド</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つと.める</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">努力</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">どりょく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">努力；尽力；奋力</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">努める</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つとめる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">努力；竭力；尽力；致力；奋力；尽心尽力</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">努めて</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つとめて</span><span class=\"k-wz\">尽可能地；尽力；勤勉地</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">精</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>精神；精华；精力；详细；精灵</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セイ・ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">しら.げる・くわ.しい</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">精神</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せいしん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">心；精神；灵魂；心境；气质；态度；心态；意志；意图；（事物的）精髓；本质；根本意义</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">精々</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せいぜい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">最多；至多；尽力；尽可能；竭尽全力</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">精巧</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せいこう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">精巧；精致；精美</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">散</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>散落；分散；散布；挥霍；散开</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ち.る・ち.らす・-ち.らす・ち.らかす・ち.らかる・ち.らばる・ばら・ばら.ける</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">散歩</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さんぽ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">散步；漫步</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">解散</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かいさん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">散会；解散（会议、集会等）；解散；清算；遣散；分裂（公司、组织等）；解散（议会、国会等）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">散る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（花瓣、叶子等）飘落；凋落；散开；分散；消失；消散；瓦解；扩散；晕开；洇开；壮烈牺牲；英勇战死</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">静</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>安静；平静；静止；平息；使安静</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セイ・ジョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">しず-・しず.か・しず.まる・しず.める</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">静か</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しずか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">安静</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">冷静</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">れいせい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">冷静；沉着；镇定；泰然自若</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">静まる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しずまる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">变安静；安静下来；平静下来；平复；消退；减弱；消散；被压制</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">婚</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>婚姻</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">結婚</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けっこん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">婚姻；结婚</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">婚約</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こんやく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">订婚；婚约</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">離婚</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">りこん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">离婚</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">喜</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>欢喜；高兴；喜悦</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">よろこ.ぶ・よろこ.ばす</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">喜ぶ</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よろこぶ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">高兴；欣喜；愉快；喜悦；祝贺；道贺；欢迎；乐于接受；乐意（做）；欣然（做）；高兴（做）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">喜び</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よろこび</span><span class=\"k-wz\">喜悦；欢乐；狂喜；愉快；满足；庆贺；祝贺</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">喜劇</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きげき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">喜剧</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">浮</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>漂浮；浮起；浮现；浮出水面；浮动</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">フ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">う.く・う.かれる・う.かぶ・う.かべる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">浮く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">漂浮；浮起；变得高兴；快乐；愉快；变得松动；不稳定；感到格格不入；感到孤立；显得突兀；轻浮；不确定；游移不定；有所剩余；节省下来；无根据；不可靠；靠不住</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">浮かぶ</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うかぶ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">浮动；悬浮；浮上；出现；浮现；显现；浮现在脑海中；产生灵感</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">浮かべる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うかべる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">使漂浮；使浮起；下水；（脸上）浮现；显露；想起；回忆；想象</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">絶</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>断绝；中断；抑制；超越；绝无仅有</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ゼツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">た.える・た.やす・た.つ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">絶対</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぜったい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">绝对地；一定；无条件地；绝对的；无条件的；确定无疑的；绝对性</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">絶滅</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぜつめつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">灭绝；消灭；根除；消灭；扑灭</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">絶えず</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たえず</span><span class=\"k-wz\">不断地；持续地；始终</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">幸</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>幸福；幸运；福气</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さいわ.い・さち・しあわ.せ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">幸運</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こううん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">好运；幸运</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">幸福</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうふく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">幸福；福祉；快乐；安康；幸福感</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">幸い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さいわい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">幸福；幸运；福气；好运；幸而得到好结果；结果顺利；有幸告终；幸运地；幸而；幸好</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">押</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>按压；推挤；压制；扣留；加盖（印章）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">オウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">お.す・お.し-・お.っ-・お.さえる・おさ.える</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">押す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">推；推动；用力推；按；按下；压；盖章；钤印；加盖印章；贴；粘贴（如金箔）；催促；施压；向某人施加压力；压倒；压制；使某人承受压力；占上风；推行；推进；继续执行（政策、计划等）；顶住；不顾；冒着；推开；确认；核实；落后于日程；延误；（围棋）压；顶着对方棋子延伸</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">押し入れ</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おしいれ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">壁橱；衣柜；推拉门柜</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">押える</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おさえる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">按住；压住；按压；固定；用手捂住（身体部位）；紧握（疼痛部位）；按压；抓住；获得；夺取；逮捕；掌握（要点）；理解；预留（时间、空间）；占住；锁定（日期）；预约；平定；镇压；抑制；遏制；控制；阻止</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">倒</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>倒下；倒塌；推翻；颠倒；垮掉</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">トウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たお.れる・-だお.れ・たお.す・さかさま・さかさ・さかしま</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">倒れる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たおれる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">倒下；跌倒；摔倒；倾覆；被摧毁；坍塌；崩裂；崩坏；倒塌；卧床不起；患病；累垮；死亡；被杀；破产；倒闭；衰落；失败；战败；输掉；推翻；被推翻；失去政权</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">倒す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たおす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">推倒；击倒；砍倒；放倒；使侧卧；使倾斜；杀死；打败；击败；推翻；绊倒；毁坏；拖欠；欺骗；彻底做；充分做；尽力做</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">面倒</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">めんどう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">麻烦；烦恼；困难；麻烦；照顾；关照</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">等</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>相等；等等；等级；类似；相同</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">トウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ひと.しい・など・-ら</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">高等学校</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうとうがっこう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">高中；高级中学</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">上等</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じょうとう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">上等；一流；优秀；上乘；好极了；来啊；尽管来</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">平等</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">びょうどう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">平等；公平；均等</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">老</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>年老；衰老；老人；老衰；老迈</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ロウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">お.いる・ふ.ける</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">老い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">老年；衰老；衰老过程；老人；老年人；年长者</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">老人</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ろうじん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">老人；老年人；年长者</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">老衰</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ろうすい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">衰老；老年衰弱；年迈体衰</span></li></ul></div></li>"]